        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A reimagining of the classic Rock-Paper-Scissors with added combos and powers. Test your reflexes and strategies:<br><strong>Climb the Tower</strong><br>Every victory pushes you higher in a mysterious tower; reach the top to win the match or remain the last climber.<br><strong>Powers</strong><br>Obtain special abilities randomly granted at the start of the match and shape your strategy over the course of various battles.<br><strong>Unlock Skins &amp; Lore</strong><br>Discover the collection of unique skins, each with its own story.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A reimagining of the classic Rock-Paper-Scissors with added combos and powers. Test your reflexes and strategies:<br><strong>Climb the Tower</strong><br>Every victory pushes you higher in a mysterious tower; reach the top to win the match or remain the last climber.<br><strong>Powers</strong><br>Obtain special abilities randomly granted at the start of the match and shape your strategy over the course of various battles.<br><strong>Unlock Skins &amp; Lore</strong><br>Discover the collection of unique skins, each with its own story.</p>",
